You are reviewing an IAM policy for a new developer. The policy below is intended to allow the user to list all S3 buckets and read objects from a single bucket named `app-data`. However, the user reports they cannot list buckets. Find the bug.

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:ListAllMyBuckets",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::app-data"
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:GetObject",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::app-data/*"
    }
  ]
}
```

A developer wrote this bucket policy to make an S3 bucket public for read-only access. It doesn't work. Find the bug.

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": "*",
      "Action": "s3:GetObject",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::my-bucket"
    }
  ]
}
```
